their magic to examine the minds of their prisoners, it was discovered that these humans bore no connection to the long-absent threat. But it was decided that it was far too risky for humans to live without supervision.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Half of the human population was enslaved and distributed throughout Halmond, while the other half was left to construct a new settlement on the Isle of Man under the watchful eye of their new overlords.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These races were matriarchal in nature, meaning women held most of the positions of power. But both male and female of these new peoples discovered an attraction for the humans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Humans became considered exotic and thus had a desirable allure for many wealthy members of the other races.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some enterprising individuals even set up brothels featuring humans as their primary attraction. One such business is the Starlit Oasis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This visual novel will detail the events of our main character\u2019s new life as an employee of a brothel featuring human men and all the fantastical women he encounters along the way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3799510/extras/cc0c315b0855ef3984d7fd3772aff127.avif?t=1754268915\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p>",
